	(text "MOTOR BRIDGE R - 2x BTS7960B full H-bridge, right-side motors (2 in parallel). Plan ~20 A stall.\nIS: 470R to GND (7 mA fault -> 3.3 V, ~1.1 V at 20 A with kILIS 8500), 1k + 10nF RC, BAT54S clamp to GND/3V3.\nSR 5.1k sets slew rate (0603: swap 0R = fastest / 51k = slowest)."
